{"ref":"BDB, אָבֵל","hw":"אָבֵל","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָבֵל</span></big>  <strong>adj. mourning</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:35\" href=\"/Genesis.37.35\">Gn 37:35</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 6:12\" href=\"/Esther.6.12\">Est 6:12</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבֶל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:14\" href=\"/Psalms.35.14\">ψ 35:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבֵלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:25\" href=\"/Job.29.25\">Jb 29:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.2\">Is 61:2</a> etc.;—for dead <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:35\" href=\"/Genesis.37.35\">Gn 37:35</a> (cp. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:11\" href=\"/Genesis.50.11\">50:11</a>), calamity <a data-ref=\"Esther 6:12\" href=\"/Esther.6.12\">Est 6:12</a>; fig. <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:4\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.4\">La 1:4</a> (pred., inanim. subj.), elsewhere as subst. <em>mourner;</em> sg. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:14\" href=\"/Psalms.35.14\">ψ 35:14</a> (cstr.) for dead (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קדר</span>; pl. <a data-ref=\"Job 29:25\" href=\"/Job.29.25\">Jb 29:25</a> abs.; for calamity <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.18\">Is 57:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.2\">61:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.3\">3</a> (where mourners for Zion, or of Zion, v. Di).","next":"BDB, אבל","prev":"BDB, אֵבֶל מִצְרַיִם"}